{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>今日（30日）上午9時47分，深水埗大埔道77號地下一間紙紮舖發生火警。消防員接報到場，出動一喉一煙帽隊灌救，約12分鐘後救熄，無人受傷，起火原因有待調查。</p><figure><img alt=\"火警救熄後仍有白煙湧出。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137339420567932928719460.jpeg/X-wXuYIjafOfxnbTOe69jqQmeNHEDf56Gq4MIBquDCA\"/><figcaption>火警救熄後仍有白煙湧出。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><p>現場可見，白煙一度湧出街頭，人員將紙紮舖的貨品搬到對開行人路。</p><p>現場消息稱，紙紮鋪的冷氣機今早曾經冒煙，店主已聯絡技工維修，惟工人未到已經起火。</p><figure><img alt=\"現場有白煙冒出。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137337448603586560972463.jpeg/iq2vu3oUUGSkCtVhSysswp9G7AP0ig81BjKgTAYyoEw\"/><figcaption>現場有白煙冒出。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"現場有白煙冒出。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137337445600333824782601.jpeg/a01fp7vFHwbnc9BLSmqTveNQ5c0QJQ-tF2Y9oBdmPaA\"/><figcaption>現場有白煙冒出。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員在場灌救。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137337442597081088942017.jpeg/7Mn32UBssH39Hw9-dc_THpZCboP4jyG85G85rORvOaw\"/><figcaption>消防員在場灌救。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"紙紮舖發生火警，消防員在場處理。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137337632984928256843751.jpeg/zNge7_k14HrygetfaeWhtk3Ie_NkG06ZTYkVnk2JFZ4\"/><figcaption>紙紮舖發生火警，消防員在場處理。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警救熄後仍有白煙湧出。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137339634192224256650893.jpeg/kZIjcnRjtYVGqprafTASHhTix2CU9eSug2ijj4Noo48\"/><figcaption>火警救熄後仍有白煙湧出。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"火警救熄後仍有白煙湧出。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137339637300334592798625.jpeg/c5oLjwuj4akKAmPm_Yra7BhFxHv5sfsuqHcuIqh3LiI\"/><figcaption>火警救熄後仍有白煙湧出。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"消防員調查火警起因。（黃偉民攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260530/1137339641469603840483027.jpeg/UExSnLb3ASiQZ-TSzzVU_pWVmq4SV637QG-fK0Bvnys\"/><figcaption>消防員調查火警起因。（黃偉民攝）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-05-30T03:18:49.330300+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":293,"images":8,"source":"HK01 突發","fallback":"none"}}